  "describes_version": "original",
  "as_of": "2015-12-03",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would impose tax on attribution managed investment trust trustees in specified cases involving excessive tax offsets allocated to members or carried forward incorrectly.",
   "The tax would equal 100 per cent of the relevant excess or shortfall, matching the amount of the tax offset discrepancy identified under companion legislation.",
   "It would form part of the new managed investment trust taxation package, with the main bill providing the rules that establish trustee liability."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Tax would be imposed when the tax offset attributed to a member exceeds the amount that should have been allocated.",
   "Tax would also cover a shortfall arising from an offset overstatement that is not properly carried forward.",
   "The tax rate for these offset discrepancies would be fixed at 100 per cent."
  ],
  "affected": "Trustees of attribution managed investment trusts would be affected.",
